=== .agents/skills/skillstation-send/SKILL.md
---
name: skillstation-send
version: 1.0.0
description: Send, check and fix skills for your Skillstation hub. Use when the user says a skill is ready to send or push to the hub, wants it checked first (security scan, compatibility, routing), or wants a hub skill that gave a wrong result, has the wrong format or needs different instructions changed and sent back. Not for writing a skill from scratch and not for using a skill in ordinary work.
